      "message": "fix(ui): a new document reaches the Setups page to create its first setup\n\nThe browser's Setups row was drawn only once a setup existed, and the\nribbon had no way to the Setups page, so a fresh document could never\nreach \"Create first setup\". The row now stands whenever the Setup\nsection is open, and the ribbon's Setup group opens on a Setups cell\n(the existing workholding glyph) that targets the page. Creating the\nfirst setup stays the undoable CreateSetup command.\n\nShell snapshots regenerated: the Setups ribbon cell (the bar re-spaced)\nand the Setups browser row are the only changes.\n\nFixes #322\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
